{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike mainstream desktop wallpaper effect programs, ForepaperEngine is an application that displays frontend content at the topmost layer of your desktop. This means it overlays a fully transparent, full-featured browser engine window above all your application windows, which provides 100% support for mainstream frontend technologies like HTML/CSS/JS, enabling personalized content development based on these standard web technologies.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601880?t=1756518985","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601880/995a3a4b06ff65cf3e0a6ad8ebb26708171c051d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756518985","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601880/fd3e1cd7ff78d88a0d4092fcc2e5cf25a20641d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756518985","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601880/fd3e1cd7ff78d88a0d4092fcc2e5cf25a20641d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756518985","categories":[{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3751130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike mainstream desktop wallpaper effect programs, ForepaperEngine is an application that displays frontend content at the topmost layer of your desktop. This means it overlays a fully transparent, full-featured browser engine window above all your application windows, which provides 100% support for ma